    <!--
      T6: Themed-icon monochrome layer for Android 13+ Material You.
      Single-color flat silhouette of the FluxLinux penguin-on-carton
      mascot. fillColor is white (#FFFFFFFF); the system applies the
      user's wallpaper-derived tint on devices that opt into themed
      icons. Replaces the previous ic_launcher_monochrome.png
      (1024x1024 multi-shade PNG) which did not tint cleanly.

      All paths use evenOdd fill so the eye dots punch through as
      transparent holes — the visible result is a clean silhouette that
      looks correct under any tint.

      Layout (108dp canvas, 66dp safe zone centred at 54,54):
        - 18..58 vertical: penguin head + body
        - 56..86 vertical: open carton with splayed flaps
    -->
